	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d09r1401_swrival_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まてよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:39:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:32:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>待てよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:51:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:32:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・posイベント
・GRIDX＝16、GRIDZ＝6～8
・まずメッセージ表示
・続けてswrival_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:51:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:39:46" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d09r1401_swrival_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『オマエ
ポケモンリーグに　むかってるよな▽
あいて　してやるよ▼
ポケモンしょうぶは　するほどに
つよく　なれるからな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:52:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:40:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『オマエ
ポケモンリーグに　向かってるよな▽
相手してやるよ▼
ポケモン勝負は　するほどに
強く　なれるからな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:52:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:51:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・画面右下から登場して
　主人公に隣接
・メッセージ表示後に
　トレーナー戦闘に
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:51:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:39:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d09r1401_swrival_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……[Name:TrainerName ]！
オマエの　おかげで
オレの　たびは　ぶじに▽
もくてきを　はたせた▼
これは　オレからの　おれい　さ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:48:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:46:04" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……[Name:TrainerName ]！
オマエの　おかげで
オレの　旅は　無事に▽
目的を　果たせた▼
これは　オレからの　お礼　さ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:52:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:51:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘後、フィールドに復帰すると
　自動で表示
・ただし下向きで
・0＝主人公名
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:50:41" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d09r1401_swrival_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレじしん　これから　どうするか
まったく　かんがえてないけどな▼
まっ　オマエは
チャンピオンに　なれよ▼
じゃーなー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:50:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:46:48" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレ自身　これから　どうするか
まったく　考えてないけどな▼
まっ　オマエは
チャンピオンに　なれよ▼
じゃーなー！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:53:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:51:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・主人公と向き合って
　メッセージ表示
・表示後、画面右下へ戻る
・画面外へ消えると主人公操作可能に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:51:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T09:40:08" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
</MessageStudioText>